**/.git
**/.gitignore
**/.gitattributes
**/.github
**/.vscode
**/.idea
**/.cursor
**/.claude
**/.DS_Store

# Next.js / build artefacts
.next
out
build
coverage
.turbo

# Dependencies (re-installed inside the image)
node_modules
.pnpm-store

# Local env files (never bake secrets into images)
.env
.env.*

# Tests / docs / tooling
**/*.md
!prisma/**/*.md
**/test
**/tests
**/__tests__
**/*.test.ts
**/*.test.tsx
**/*.spec.ts
**/*.spec.tsx
playwright-report
test-results
# The `**/test` rule above is meant for test dirs, but it also matches the
# app-router API route `app/api/connections/test/` — which must ship in the
# image (dropping it makes /api/connections/test 405). Re-include it.
!app/api/connections/test
!app/api/connections/test/**

# Logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
.pnpm-debug.log*
